{
  "slug": "sagemaker-ai",
  "name": "Sagemaker Ai",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build, train, and deploy AI models with deep AWS AI/ML expertise brought directly into your coding assistants, covering the surface area of Amazon SageMaker AI.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **19 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (19): `dataset-evaluation` (Validates dataset formatting and quality for SageMaker model fine-tuning (SFT, DPO, or RLVR)), `dataset-transformation` (Generates code that transforms datasets between ML schemas for model training or evaluation), `directory-management` (Manages project directory setup and artifact organization), `finetuning` (Generates code that fine-tunes a base model using SageMaker serverless training jobs), `finetuning-technique` (Selects a fine-tuning technique (SFT, DPO, RLVR, or RLAIF) for the user's use case and validates it against…), `hyperpod-cluster-debugger` (Diagnose and remediate cluster-wide HyperPod (EKS or Slurm) problems — creation / deployment failures (CloudFormation, EFA health check,…), `hyperpod-issue-report` (Generate comprehensive issue reports from HyperPod clusters (EKS and Slurm) by collecting diagnostic logs and configurations for troubleshooting…), `hyperpod-nccl` (Diagnose NCCL failures and adjacent training-pod failures on HyperPod GPU clusters (EKS or Slurm) — training hangs, AllReduce…), and 11 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `aws-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sagemaker-ai@claude-plugins-official` from `awslabs/agent-plugins` (`plugins/sagemaker-ai`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
